But I got to get something off my chest

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:14.610
This episode marks the end of the five-part series and this explains the majority of Sekiro's story

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:17.699
This was a really lore heavy episode

00:17:17.699 --> 00:17:24.389
I know not everyone can stick through these long heavy episodes, but I'm actually quite proud of this series

00:17:24.610 --> 00:17:26.610
Which is rare for me to say

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:33.270
Because I feel like this series uncovered a lot of lore that has never been written about online before and

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:40.000
I think this series will stand as a really good resource for people looking to uncover the deeper meaning

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:44.340
That the game has and the game does have a deeper meaning obviously

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:47.540
You know that but a lot of people don't know that because

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:52.180
Unlike something like Dark Souls people don't look for the deeper meaning in Sekiro

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:56.969
Because Sekiro already has a really obvious surface level story

00:17:57.460 --> 00:18:02.160
But the depth is there and it's good and I hope you share it with some other people

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:08.840
So I'm happy that I could bring some of that to light and I'm happy that there's some of you who are still listening who

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:14.640
Clearly appreciate that story, too. So thank you for being a part of this and I'll see you next time

